      "paragraphs": [
        "The Toronto Maple Leafs have parted ways with assistant general manager Hayley Wickenheiser as new GM John Chayka continues a sweeping front office overhaul. This move marks the latest shift in the organization's leadership, with Wickenheiser having spent eight years with the team, including four seasons as AGM.",
        "The Toronto Blue Jays beat the Padres 5-3 last night, riding Yuki Okamoto's record-tying blast to a tidy win. Tonight, the Jays return to face the Padres again at 8:40 PM ET on Sportsnet, holding a 45-49 record and sitting third in the AL East. The Toronto Raptors are active in Summer League, where Graves recently made his debut in a narrow 83-80 loss to the Celtics. In Washington, the Commanders are preparing for training camp, with their next preseason game set against the Eagles on Sunday, September 13, 64 days away.",
